# Cloudflare Pages routing for the store-listing pages in this folder.
#
# Most of them need no rule at all: Pages serves `archivex/privacy.html` at
# /archivex/privacy by itself, which is the address Google Play has on file.
# Only an address that does not match its file's location needs a line here.
#
# Status 200 serves the file at the requested address without redirecting, so
# the URL Google Play checks answers directly.
#
# nginx (config/nginx/pickixo.com.conf) ignores this file; it has its own
# `location` block for each page.

# Maaz Bangla Keyboard: the Play listing points at a root-level .html address,
# while the file lives in the app's own folder.
/maaz-privacy-policy.html  /maaz-bangla-keyboard/privacy  200
/maaz-privacy-policy       /maaz-bangla-keyboard/privacy  200
